{"ancestors": "0,9015970", "bizKey": "9015977", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-07-12 15:33:56", "detail": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">题材基本面介绍：</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">轮胎是炭黑最重要的应用领域。</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">炭黑是由烃类裂解和不完全燃烧制得的黑色粉末状或颗粒状物质，主要由碳元素组成，其微晶具有准石墨结构，且呈同心取向，由近乎球形或其他不规则形状的粒子构成，基本粒子尺寸为10～100nm。</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">根据生产工艺的不同，炭黑可分为槽黑、炉黑和热裂黑。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/12/c35076f9-c1a6-4452-82c7-f31384d78c01-1689147376180.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 383.31px;height: 100.73px;\"/></p><p>2019年我国前五大炭黑企业的产能占比却不足35%，产能集中度仍有很大的提升空间。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/12/a610644e-c8e8-4ff4-956b-98456dd27fa4-1689147672448.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 386.00px;height: 286.13px;\"/></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "TH", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 2, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "炭黑", "parentId": 9015970, "pctChg": -1.88, "reason": "轮胎是炭黑最重要的应用领域", "remark": "", "sort": 3, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9015977, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-07-12 15:41:21"}
